{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And they journeyed from Rameses</b> — afterward it is written ויסעו בנ\"י מרעמסס. At first they journeyed in a mixture, the erev rav among them, and afterward, when enumerating the journeys, all of them he mentions בני ישראל, for they separated the erev rav from among them." "<b>The children of Israel went out with a high hand before the eyes of all</b> Egypt. To say that also the erev rav, who are Egyptians, went out with a high hand before the eyes of the rest of Egypt:"], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {0 "Resolved בנ\"י as בני ישראל."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:23:37.981665820Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}